OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe new week will start dry
OL,6,Fwith areas of cloud soon breaking up
OL,7,Fduring the morning, with plenty of
OL,8,Fwarm sunshine developing. However, by
OL,9,Fthe afternoon a further increase in
OL,10,Fcloud could help generate a few
OL,11,Fshowery bursts of rain.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FNorthern and western areas
OL,14,Fare likely to have a cloudy evening
OL,15,Fand night with outbreaks of rain, some
OL,16,Fheavy. Further south and east it looks
OL,17,Fdrier with occasional clear intervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
