OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FTuesday looks rather
OL,6,Funsettled. There will be a lot of
OL,7,Fcloud around, with some showers which
OL,8,Fcould be heavy with local thunder.
OL,9,FStill warm in any brighter breaks
OL,10,Fthough.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCooler
OL,13,Fand rather breezy on Wednesday with
OL,14,Ffurther showers possible. A drier and
OL,15,Fless breezy end to the week with some
OL,16,Fsunshine, though feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
